1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
일요일 밤 아홉 시, 벌써 월요일인가요?
At 9 p.m. on a Sunday, hasn't Monday already begun?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,857
세네카는 말했어요.
Seneca wrote,

3
00:00:05,957 --> 00:00:13,024
우리는 현실보다 상상 속에서 더 자주 괴롭다고.
"There are more things … likely to frighten us than there are to crush us;
we suffer more often in imagination than in reality."

4
00:00:13,124 --> 00:00:17,711
누우면 천장에 뜨는 내일 회의.
After a shower, tomorrow's meeting floats up on the ceiling.

5
00:00:17,811 --> 00:00:23,500
그 무게는 아직 오지 않은 일일지도요.
That weight may be what hasn't happened yet, carried early.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
월요일은 내일 아침에 오면 돼요.
Monday can arrive tomorrow morning.
